{"posts":[{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_726","t":"Mr Fish wrote:\n\nHave already seen some major errors in my first upload\n\nHere are some more without errors hopefully.","a":"Mr Fish","d":"","n":"#726","p":30,"im":["893dfc363011253fd333a9babaabce811339a299","a272af7450fa50528b0ced4a1a6b7c9484e86618"],"m":726},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_727","t":"Great work!","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#727","p":30,"im":[],"m":727},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_728","t":"Even in a trading range RBD and DBD respect","a":"Mr Fish","d":"","n":"#728","p":30,"im":["a482389963f2807e0097f288624c37a0117a1aa6"],"m":728},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_729","t":"Again, good charting job, Mr Fish.\n\nIn your chart we have a nice swap zone (where supply become demand and vise versa). Find it, and see how powerful it is.","a":"benhur","d":"","n":"#729","p":30,"im":[],"m":729},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_730","t":"Hi everyone, my first homework here.\n\nI start with the Daily GBP/USD and then i will drill down in the lower TF's.\n\nreviews are most welcome","a":"Piper","d":"","n":"#730","p":30,"im":["ea1b46ba9ed6e8860906d41d98019bb489ddb0f5"],"m":730},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_731","t":"Thank you for looking at my charts Ben Hur and I greatly appreciate the prods. I could have it way off, but this is what my current understanding tells me.","a":"Mr Fish","d":"","n":"#731","p":30,"im":["9bd53ad33d226373f8992847963530a49d6fa0bc"],"m":731},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_732","t":"Just scrolled forward to today's action and the same line by luck or chance or beginners luck had 2 perfect reactions.","a":"Mr Fish","d":"","n":"#732","p":30,"im":["7b8e8e942078690d87d61ee51fe3acaacb30a82b"],"m":732},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_733","t":"here is the 4h chart. the market has moved a bit in the direction of the daily analysis. nut i will drill down even more.\n\nany inputs will be greatly appreciated since i do not know if i am doing it right,","a":"Piper","d":"","n":"#733","p":30,"im":["1e70fbbc239816c13702dd5e3a3bf51cbfc4d25b"],"m":733},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_734","t":"Hi piper - I had that exact line on my gold chart. That last circle was a reaction to that left shoulder FO level - and it worked perfectly.\n\nThey make for such a great setup.\n\nPeds","a":"Pedini","d":"","n":"#734","p":30,"im":[],"m":734},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_735","t":"Hello Friends: My 1st homework attempt for Drop Base Rallies and Rally Base Drops.\n\nYour feedback is very welcome.\n\nDon","a":"DonStar","d":"","n":"#735","p":30,"im":["4e0c1e27f1dfe173bd387ed8f4af77c3eb9ffb5d"],"m":735},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_736","t":"","a":"DonStar","d":"","n":"#736","p":30,"im":["c26622f45a4a76d5ab4c5beaa3c663fe33bba551"],"m":736},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_737","t":"Daily chart. Looking for feedback.\n\nThank you,\n\nDon","a":"DonStar","d":"","n":"#737","p":30,"im":["903a1c2f479d1aa8ad3e86c59cda05194cffb65a"],"m":737},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_738","t":"Howya lads.\n\nMy first bit of homework. Be gentle:)","a":"redrob","d":"","n":"#738","p":30,"im":[],"m":738},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_739","t":"","a":"redrob","d":"","n":"#739","p":30,"im":["464c4ed842092dd024b2e89d1683475d3b81fb0a"],"m":739},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_740","t":"Apologies for the colours, art was never my strong point in school. All comments gratefully received.\n\nCheers","a":"redrob","d":"","n":"#740","p":30,"im":["6572572c17bf71a26bd3442c3eb59871e31ae6b7"],"m":740},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_741","t":"Same chart as above but with more to the right of chart.","a":"redrob","d":"","n":"#741","p":30,"im":["b5f6222a85cc036fb0f270142a06669ff2e380ef"],"m":741},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_742","t":"Hi everyone, this is my first post. I am trying to spot the RBD or DBR setups and how one might trade them. I'll attach 3 examples I think are valid. Could you let me know if I am doing this correctly? Thanks in advance.\n\nPaul","a":"Kerinsp","d":"","n":"#742","p":30,"im":["7a2161dc629eec1c7022f2c47d7f6228d46d46ea","609ae4aa2e2eaec49c80a7f86f81e02abf4713f2","f0f5bcbaa8939a69c4cd3b99a4d29d60de07c7ff"],"m":742},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_743","t":"Hi guys,\n\nHere is my first homework. I've attached 2 charts, daily and H4 EURUSD. I've marked the RBD/DBR according to my current knowledge.\n\nAs some of you may notice, it looks like I've used the SupDem indicator which draws the zones for you. I did draw the zones manually, I just like the how the indicator draws them on the charts.\n\nNote: I didn't draw the RBD/DBRs which are already taken out. I know they are there though.\n\nAny advice or comments are appreciated.","a":"Apprenti","d":"","n":"#743","p":30,"im":["d20c70369fa57e04aa47b577a70ea0f0032ab559","b83ad22a93e743ab71f6bdc8e917e310b952401a"],"m":743},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_744","t":"Some more homework and more to come, stating to see more things on the charts - I need a bigger screen:)","a":"Mr Fish","d":"","n":"#744","p":30,"im":["4f78d53c245230087acf6220df5de0c54b7b21ba","f95283d1c20ff79c1c6dee05681719ea8b45ea0e"],"m":744},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_745","t":"Mr Fish wrote: Some more homework and more to come, stating to see more things on the charts - I need a bigger screen:)\n\nHey Mr. Fish.\n\nI have a comment on your ignored supply that you have marked. I was chatting with FX Sniffer some time ago and addressed this point with him. I am not sure if that would really be considered ignored as it did react. To make sure I am clear I pointed to what I think you marked as ignored supply with a yellow arrow. I think the reaction was the area that the red arrow is pointing to. From what I gathered from FX was that my area marked with a purple box would be ignored as price shot straight through it. This is just my two cents. I thought it might help you.","a":"Hotochin","d":"","n":"#745","p":30,"im":["4f78d53c245230087acf6220df5de0c54b7b21ba","9506dfe6e65e2f35e8781ae1ad97d63637875552"],"m":745},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_746","t":"Thanks Hotochin, I see what you are saying and yes, it does look as though it had a reaction of sorts.","a":"Mr Fish","d":"","n":"#746","p":30,"im":[],"m":746},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_747","t":"A query.\n\nCould I call these areas that I marked as \"ignored supply\"? and If it's correct to mark in this way...","a":"Mrgerry","d":"","n":"#747","p":30,"im":["c3542296a0617d18a9a5d32a3703765f60010e9f"],"m":747},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_748","t":"Hey Mrgerry,\n\nBased on my conversation with FX Sniffer the answer is yes. To be ignored you don't want any reaction at all. Your yellow arrows are ignored areas when price blows right through them.","a":"Hotochin","d":"","n":"#748","p":30,"im":[],"m":748},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_749","t":"Ok, after reading this thread, I start my homework too. Please tell me what you think, correct my mistakes and tell me if i am going right","a":"Sharky","d":"","n":"#749","p":30,"im":["b027c51be35622d0d1663066a67b49dbd5cc6665","ed0d93b7e4433db2c9d7a6fc493940569d8e8012","4210f03362006ea0200fe72f04c292db12979762"],"m":749},{"id":"dbrrbd_p30_750","t":"Yo guys, other examples","a":"Sharky","d":"","n":"#750","p":30,"im":["dba7d0fac38b70101ae07b1fed2c8368e9fd0a0d","078630714678e1787471b14d81be707d347b0b0e"],"m":750}],"images":[{"k":"893dfc363011253fd333a9babaabce811339a299","t":"assets/thumbs/893dfc363011253fd333a9babaabce811339a299.webp","f":"assets/images/893dfc363011253fd333a9babaabce811339a299.png","w":1276,"h":664,"b":30754,"o":"893dfc363011253fd333a9babaabce811339a299.png","p":30,"pid":"dbrrbd_p30_726"},{"k":"a272af7450fa50528b0ced4a1a6b7c9484e86618","t":"assets/thumbs/a272af7450fa50528b0ced4a1a6b7c9484e86618.webp","f":"assets/images/a272af7450fa50528b0ced4a1a6b7c9484e86618.png","w":1276,"h":664,"b":34649,"o":"a272af7450fa50528b0ced4a1a6b7c9484e86618.png","p":30,"pid":"dbrrbd_p30_726"},{"k":"a482389963f2807e0097f288624c37a0117a1aa6","t":"assets/thumbs/a482389963f2807e0097f288624c37a0117a1aa6.webp","f":"assets/images/a482389963f2807e0097f288624c37a0117a1aa6.png","w":1276,"h":664,"b":29796,"o":"a482389963f2807e0097f288624c37a0117a1aa6.png","p":30,"pid":"dbrrbd_p30_728"},{"k":"ea1b46ba9ed6e8860906d41d98019bb489ddb0f5","t":"assets/thumbs/ea1b46ba9ed6e8860906d41d98019bb489ddb0f5.webp","f":"assets/images/ea1b46ba9ed6e8860906d41d98019